2026-08-07T13:50:39.0173537Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-08-07T13:50:39.0174669Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-08-07T13:50:39.0175529Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
